<title>UK: BOE allots 75 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 75 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 75 million stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted 51 million stg in bills outright and 24 million stg in repos to April 1, bringing total liquidity provided to the market to 725 million stg.</p>
<p>The Bank's latest shortage forecast was 700 million.</p>
</text>
